Package: distiller
Title: R Companion for the Distiller Typst Package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Dragonfly Data Science", email = "edward@dragonfly.co.nz",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Converts gt tables to distiller data-table() calls for Typst output.
    Provides a knit_print method that automatically renders gt tables using
    distiller's formatting when targeting Typst output from Quarto.
